}
]
}
]
},
{
"level": "B1",
"el": "Διπλοί τύποι",
"title": "Double forms: spoken and written",
"body": [
{
"p": "Many everyday nouns have a **spoken** form and a **written** or formal form. Both are correct; choose by situation."
},
